    <p>&copy; {year} {site.name}. Designed and built by me.</p>
    <p>
      Set in Instrument Serif and Geist. Built with Astro and Tailwind, hosted on Vercel.
      <a href="#top" class="link ml-2 whitespace-nowrap">Back to top &uarr;</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
